# Corrado di Spoleto, il Colosso delle Forge. Mi frigio, corno che martella, incudine.
titolo: Gubbio 1151 - Corrado
bpm: 160
battuta: 16
canale canto ciaramella 150
canale corno corno 100
canale bordone bordone 128
canale tamburo tamburo 140
canale cassa grancassa 128
canale incudine incudine 170

def riff: E3:3 E3:3 F3:2 E3:3 E3:3 G3:2
def riff2: E3:3 E3:3 F3:2 G3:3 F3:3 D3:2
def riffi: $riff | $riff | $riff | $riff2 | $riff | $riff | $riff | $riff2 |
def leadA: B4:8 C5:4 B4:4 | A4:4 G4:4 F4:8 | E4:4 F4:4 G4:4 A4:4 | B4:12 r:4 |
def leadA: E5:8 D5:4 C5:4 | D5:4 C5:4 B4:8 | C5:4 B4:4 A4:4 F4:4 | E4:16 |
def leadB: G5:4 F5:4 E5:4 F5:4 | E5:4 D5:4 C5:8 | D5:4 C5:4 B4:4 C5:4 | B4:16 |
def leadB: G5:4 F5:4 E5:4 F5:4 | E5:4 D5:4 C5:8 | B4:4 A4:4 G4:4 F4:4 | E4:16 |
def tamb: (X:2 x:2 x:2 x:2)*16
def cassa: (X:4 x:4 X:4 x:4)*8
def incud: (r:4 x:4 r:4 X:4)*8

ordine: I *A B

[I] 32
corno: !44 $riff $riff
cassa: !46 (X:4 x:4 X:4 x:4)*2
incudine: X:16!44 X:16
bordone: E2:32!30

[A] 128
canto: !46 $leadA
corno: !40 $riffi
bordone: ~:128
tamburo: !32 $tamb
cassa: !44 $cassa
incudine: !34 $incud

[B] 128
canto: !48 $leadB
corno: !42 $riffi
bordone: ~:128
tamburo: !34 $tamb
cassa: !46 $cassa
incudine: !36 $incud
